<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims series 3.360 to be paid for on November 14, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on November 12.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on November 7, raised 972.25 million francs and was priced at 99.557 percent to yield 1.76 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
</text>
